messages.en:
{07 0a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Buggy-wugs, {01 00 00 0a 00}buggy-mugs!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Today's the official
{04 03 00} {ff 00 00 03}Bug-Off{ff 00 00 00}!
{07 00 00}So, sprout, {01 00 00 03 00}would you{01 00 00 0a 00} like
me to explain{01 00 00 05 00} the {ff 00 00 03}Bug-Off{ff 00 00 00}
to you?{02 04 00 06 05}
Please!
Bug off!

messages.et:
{07 0a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Putu-nutu, {01 00 00 0a 00}putu-mutu!{01 00 00 0f 00}
Täna on ametlik
{04 03 00} {ff 00 00 03}putukavõistlus{ff 00 00 00}!
{07 00 00}Nii, võsuke, {01 00 00 03 00}kas sa tahad{01 00 00 0a 00},
et selgitaksin{01 00 00 05 00}
{ff 00 00 03}putukavõistlust{ff 00 00 00} sulle?{02 04 00 06 05}
Palun!
Kao ära!

messages.en:
{07 00 00}By the way, {04 00 00},{01 00 00 0f 00}
did you want to hear about
the {ff 00 00 03}Bug-Off{ff 00 00 00}?{02 04 00 06 05}
Yes!
No, not really.

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Muide, {04 00 00},{01 00 00 0f 00}
kas sa tahtsid kuulda
{ff 00 00 03}putukavõistlusest{ff 00 00 00}?{02 04 00 06 05}
Jah!
Ei, mitte eriti.

messages.en:
{07 00 00}Well, the {ff 00 00 03}Bug-Off{ff 00 00 00}, you see,{01 00 00 05 00}
is a day-long bug-catching
contest that ends at 6 p.m.{01 00 00 05 00}
Whoever catches the
{ff 00 00 02}biggest bug{ff 00 00 00} wins!{01 00 00 05 00} Of
course, I'll be judging,
so just bring them to me
for the official measuring!{01 01 00}
Do you want to hear more?{02 04 00 07 05}
Yes, please.
Bug off!

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Noh, {ff 00 00 03}putukavõistlus{ff 00 00 00} on,{01 00 00 05 00}
päevapikkune putukapüügi
võistlus, mis lõpeb kell 18.{01 00 00 05 00}
Kes püüab {ff 00 00 02}suurima
putuka{ff 00 00 00}, võidab!{01 00 00 05 00} Muidugi
olen mina kohtunik,
nii et too nad mulle
ametlikuks mõõtmiseks!{01 01 00}
Kas tahad rohkem kuulda?{02 04 00 07 05}
Jah, palun.
Kao ära!

messages.en:
{07 00 00}Let the memory of my
{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}
{01 00 00 05 00}{07 14 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}continue to inspire you!
{07 00 00}You are in the running for
first place in the {ff 00 00 03}Bug-Off{ff 00 00 00}!{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Heh heh, {01 00 00 05 00}HOORF BLAK! {01 00 00 05 00}HOORF!

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Las minu
{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00} mälestus
{01 00 00 05 00}{07 14 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}inspireerib sind edasi!
{07 00 00}Sa oled {ff 00 00 03}putukavõistlusel{ff 00 00 00}
esikoha kandidaat!{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Heh heh, {01 00 00 05 00}HOORF BLAK! {01 00 00 05 00}HOORF!

messages.en:
{07 14 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Will the lovely prize of
{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}
inspire you to victory?!
I think you can do it,
sprout! {01 00 00 05 00}Just try your best!{01 00 00 0f 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0f 00}Heh HOORF! {01 00 00 05 00}Oh ho ho!

messages.et:
{07 14 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Kas võrratu auhind
{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}
inspireerib sind võitma?!
Arvan, et sa suudad,
võsuke! {01 00 00 05 00}Anna endast parim!{01 00 00 0f 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0f 00}Heh HOORF! {01 00 00 05 00}Oh ho hoo!

messages.en:
{07 14 00}Now don't get a big head--{01 00 00 0a 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Heh heh {01 00 00 05 00}HEEorf! {01 00 00 05 00}Hoo hoorf!{01 00 00 14 00}
But that was quite a feat!
{07 00 00}And for being the number-
one bug catcher,{01 00 00 05 00} you get a
special prize!

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Ära nüüd tähtsaks minna--{01 00 00 0a 00}
{07 03 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Heh heh {01 00 00 05 00}HEEorf! {01 00 00 05 00}Hoo hoorf!{01 00 00 14 00}
Aga see oli alles vägitegu!
{07 00 00}Ja number ühe putuka-
püüdjana{01 00 00 05 00} saad sa
erilise auhinna!

messages.en:
{07 09 00}What's that now, sprout?{01 00 00 0a 00}
Just get me some bugs,
I say!

messages.et:
{07 09 00}Mis nüüd, võsuke?{01 00 00 0a 00}
To mulle lihtsalt putukaid,
ütlen ma!
